stateDiagram-v2
[*] --> ASSIGNED
ASSIGNED --> FAILED : active mission / unsuitable agent / unavailable agent / insufficient resources / environment restriction
ASSIGNED --> IN_PROGRESS : advanceTime(1)
IN_PROGRESS --> COMPLETED : duration reached
IN_PROGRESS --> FAILED : equipment failure / dust storm / communication disruption / rover breakdown
COMPLETED --> [*]
FAILED --> [*] : terminal state; create a new Mission to retry
